  "notes": "Warm cream paper background with off-white rounded panels and a deep teal primary. Each listener card has a colored left edge (blue Mateo, green Lucy, purple Ines) matching the avatar circle and progress bar. The now-playing artwork is a green gradient block with the word 'Dino' instead of an image. Glyphs are unicode characters (⏮ ↺ ↻ ✕ ↑ ↓) rather than an icon set. Live behavior: the header countdowns tick, Play toggles to Pause and updates the status pill, removing a queue item turns the coverage bar red with a '43 min short' warning, and choosing a catch-up option shows a dark toast at the bottom (not in the capture). The queue can hold non-media 'Quiet stretch' blocks, shown in lavender. The chapter list encodes per-listener heard / partly heard / missed status in red text and number chips."
